        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1562, Wood Door Automatic Flush Bolts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSelf latching automatic flush bolts for use on fire rated wood doors (labeled B, C, D & E). Fits standard ANSI prep for wood doors. Conform to UL, 10C and UBC 7-2-1997. ADA compliant, requires only 5 lbs. of force. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFully automatic flush bolts - inactive door is latched by both both top and bottom flush bolts when active door closes. Both flush bolts retract when active door opens. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1562_size.gif?v=1704354506\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1562 Wood Door Automatic Flush Bolts size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged in pairs - includes both top and bottom flush door bolts. Also includes strike plates, guide plates and installation screws. Available in Polished Brass, Oil Rubbed Bronze or Brushed Chrome finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1562 Automatic Flush Bolts:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Height: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Frame Strike Plate Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Frame Strike Plate Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Plate Length: 6-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Vertical Adjustment: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed and Rated</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.3 Type 25</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1562.pdf?v=1704262297\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1562 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold in Pairs (2 Flush Bolts with installation hardware). </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Automatic Flush Bolts for Wood Door, Don-Jo 1562",
                "description": "Don-Jo 1562 Automatic Flush Bolts. Self latching automatic flush bolts for use on fire rated wood doors (labeled B, C, D & E). Fits standard ANSI prep for wood doors. Conform to UL, 10C and UBC 7-2-1997. ADA compliant, requires only 5 lbs. of force. Fully automatic flush bolts - inactive door is latched by both both top and bottom flush bolts when active door closes. Both flush bolts retract when active door opens. ",
                "keywords": "DJO-1562 Automatic Flush Bolts for wood Doors, Don-Jo 1562 Automatic Flush Bolts, self locking flush bolts, wooden door bolts, fire door bolts, UL 10C, UL UBC 7-2-1997, ANSI A156.3 Type 25, ADA compliant Automatic Flush Bolts, long door bolts, lock french doors, french door locks, 6 inch edge door bolts, french door bolts, fire door edge bolts, Don-Jo 1562-626, Don-Jo 1562-605, Don-Jo 1562-613,"
